- Node.js 22.23.2，npx vitest run src/tests/sourceModuleCasing.test.ts src/tests/PdfAnnotationReview.test.tsx src/tests/PdfAnnotationRecovery.test.tsx src/tests/objectWorkbenchController.test.tsx src/tests/notesView.test.tsx src/tests/paperAnchorResources.test.tsx src/tests/PdfWhiteboard.test.tsx src/tests/pdfWhiteboardStorage.test.ts：8 个文件、30 项全部通过。
